2
00:02:57,320 --> 00:03:03,480
本日は、風真いろは2周年ライブにお越しいただきまして、誠にありがとうございます。
Thank you all so much for joining us today for Kazama Iroha's 2nd Anniversary Live.

3
00:03:04,140 --> 00:03:09,100
本公演をご覧になるにあたっての、注意事項を説明いたします。
I would like to explain a few important notes before you enjoy the performance.

4
00:03:10,020 --> 00:03:12,780
その1、全力で楽しみ！
Rule number one: Enjoy it with all your might!

5
00:03:13,260 --> 00:03:16,140
その2、全力でコメントをし！
Rule number two: Comment with all your might!

6
00:03:16,820 --> 00:03:19,460
その3、全力でスクショを撮り！
Rule number three: Take screenshots with all your might!

7
00:03:20,100 --> 00:03:25,420
その4、全力でハッシュタグ風真いろは2周年ライブでつぶやき！
Rule number four: Post tweets with all your might using the hashtag Kazama Iroha 2nd Anniversary Live!

8
00:03:26,100 --> 00:03:29,800
その5、全力で幸せな気持ちになっていってください。
Rule number five: Let yourselves become filled with happy feelings!

9
00:03:30,980 --> 00:03:33,200
それでは、まもなく開演いたします。
Now then, the show will begin shortly.

10
00:03:33,720 --> 00:03:38,080
風真いろはは、どこへでも行ける！
Kazama Iroha can go anywhere!

11
00:03:48,240 --> 00:03:51,300
きらきら光ってるはずなんだ
It's supposed to be shining so brightly...

12
00:04:04,320 --> 00:04:07,480
キャキャキャパシティオーバー てんてこまいの毎日だ
C-c-c-capacity over, it's a hectic everyday life!

13
00:04:08,740 --> 00:04:12,120
頭こんがらがって warning, warning
My head gets all tangled up, warning, warning!

14
00:04:12,280 --> 00:04:15,100
でっかい月の上にウサギがいるんだっけ？
Isn't there a rabbit up on the giant moon?

15
00:04:16,120 --> 00:04:19,460
宇宙旅行にパスポートって要りますか
Do you need a passport for space travel?

16
00:04:41,980 --> 00:04:45,000
地球の裏から 夢の中まで
From the other side of the Earth, right into our dreams...

17
00:04:45,340 --> 00:04:48,060
Escort 君を escort
Escort, I'll escort you!

18
00:04:48,360 --> 00:04:51,100
マニュアル通りじゃつまんないでしょ
Just following the manual would be boring, wouldn't it?

19
00:04:51,400 --> 00:04:55,100
不安の数だけ希望があるってこと
That there is just as much hope as there are anxieties—

20
00:04:56,120 --> 00:04:59,320
きらきら光ってるはずなんだ
It's supposed to be shining so brightly!

21
00:05:05,808 --> 00:05:11,308
エマージェンシーじゃん！ なんでもありのアイドルだ 常識もグラついちゃって panic, panic
It's an emergency! We're idols where anything goes, and common sense is wobbling, panic, panic!

22
00:05:12,708 --> 00:05:19,308
深海 海の底でマーメイドが恋をしたって？ 嘘か本当か確かめに行きませんか
At the bottom of the deep sea, a mermaid fell in love? Shall we go check if it's true or a lie?

23
00:05:22,008 --> 00:05:31,708
僕らの暮らしてるセカイは人ひとりひとつの色 それはお父さんお母さんのあいのいろ
The world we live in has a unique color for every single person... That is the color of love from our fathers and mothers.

24
00:05:33,208 --> 00:05:38,808
雨降り天気でも会いに行くよ 果報が来るまで寝とけばいいってマジ？
Even in rainy weather, I'll go see you! Is it true I should just sleep until good fortune comes?

25
00:05:39,808 --> 00:05:44,008
いや いや 待てるわけなくね
No, no, there's no way I can wait!

26
00:05:46,008 --> 00:05:50,508
絶好調 もうずっと絶好調 片道切符で構わないでしょ?
In top form, already in top form forever! A one-way ticket is fine, right?

27
00:05:51,008 --> 00:05:55,808
無理も通せば道理がなんとやら
If you push the unreasonable, even reason will somehow follow!

28
00:05:56,208 --> 00:06:00,808
高く 高く 跳べる気がしてるんだ
I feel like I can jump higher and higher!

29
00:06:23,008 --> 00:06:28,208
胸の奥がキュッとなる 消えない 消せない過去も笑えるように
A tightness in my chest... So that even unshakeable, unforgettable past can become something to laugh about

30
00:06:29,008 --> 00:06:37,508
未来が僕らを呼んでる ほら 踊れる曲は踊っとくのが楽しむコツ
The future is calling out to us! Look, dancing to songs you can dance to is the secret to having fun!

31
00:06:39,508 --> 00:06:45,308
I shall checkmate 君を checkmate 会いたい時には会いに行くよ
I shall checkmate you, checkmate! When I want to see you, I'll go see you

32
00:06:46,508 --> 00:06:52,508
机の奥から 22世紀まで ふらふら 旅してる途中
From the back of the desk all the way to the 22nd century, wandering along on a journey

33
00:06:53,008 --> 00:06:59,808
Escort 君を escort マニュアル通りじゃつまんないでしょ?
Escort you, escort! Doing things strictly by the manual is boring, right?

34
00:07:00,008 --> 00:07:03,208
不安の数だけ希望があるってこと
Every single anxiety corresponds to an equal amount of hope!

35
00:07:03,808 --> 00:07:11,208
高く 高く 跳べる気がしてる きらきら 光ってるはずなんだ
I feel like I can jump higher and higher! It's supposed to be shining sparkling bright!

36
00:07:14,008 --> 00:07:27,508
エマージェンシーじゃん！ なんでもありのアイドルだ...
It's an emergency! We're idols where anything goes...

37
00:07:37,808 --> 00:07:46,008
ここまでいろんな村を旅してきたでござるが...
I've traveled through various villages up until now...

38
00:07:46,308 --> 00:07:50,508
あったかい人にね、たくさんの方々に触れて...
Meeting warm people, touching upon so many folks...

39
00:07:50,708 --> 00:07:57,808
世界にはいろんな人がいるでござるな。
There truly are all kinds of people in this world.

40
00:07:59,508 --> 00:08:09,508
おっ、そういえば二つ前の村でいただいた、あの紫色のおナスっていう野菜は...まことに、まことに美味でござったな！
Oh, come to think of it, that purple eggplant-like vegetable we got in the village two stops ago... was truly, truly delicious!

41
00:08:10,008 --> 00:08:18,508
またどこかで食べる機会があれば、絶対...たくさん旅を...うっ...
If I ever get the chance to eat it somewhere again, I'll definitely... travel a lot more... ugh...

42
00:08:19,008 --> 00:08:22,508
あっ、そんなこと言ってる場合じゃない。さっさと...
Ah, this is no time to be saying that. I should quickly...

43
00:08:22,508 --> 00:08:31,008
次の村を目指して、今日も流浪の旅でござる！目指すは侍ナンバーワンでござる！
Head to the next village, continuing my wandering journey today too! My goal is to be the number one samurai!

44
00:08:33,008 --> 00:08:41,008
まあ、風真のこのフィジカルをもってすればどんな敵も、どんな危険もへっちゃらでござる...
Well, with Kazama's physical prowess, any enemy or danger is a breeze...

45
00:08:41,008 --> 00:08:46,508
けど...やっぱ心配だな。
But... I'm still worried.

46
00:08:46,508 --> 00:08:51,508
1人でいくのは怖いし...あ、そ、そういう時のポコべ...？
Going alone is scary and... Ah, P-Pokobe at times like that...?

47
00:08:51,508 --> 00:08:56,508
あれ？ポコべ？あーー、またポコべ...
Huh? Pokobe? Aah, Pokobe again...

48
00:08:56,508 --> 00:09:01,008
はぐれてしまったでござるか？えっ、いないの？いなくなっちゃったじゃあ...もう...！
Did we get separated? Huh, they're not here? If they're gone... Oh no...!

49
00:09:01,508 --> 00:09:09,008
今日はおでんの匂いもあり、おてんとう様もかげってきちゃったし...あーー、どこ行ったでござるか...？
Today there was the smell of oden, and the sun has gone overcast... Aah, where did you go...?

50
00:09:12,008 --> 00:09:18,008
えっ、待って。いってるそばから雨でござるか？
Huh, wait. Right as I say that, is it starting to rain?

51
00:09:18,508 --> 00:09:26,508
全く！おいポコべ！どこ行ったでござるかポコべー！なんか寒くなってきたし...
Honestly! Hey, Pokobe! Where did you go, Pokobeee! It's getting cold...

52
00:09:26,508 --> 00:09:36,008
その辺が寂しいでござる...ポコベ...どこだい、を...
It feels so lonely around here... Pokobe... Where are you, oh...

53
00:09:38,508 --> 00:09:47,008
先の見えない流浪の旅、この先何者になってどう生きればいいんだろうか。
A wandering journey with no end in sight—what kind of person will I become, and how should I live from here on?

54
00:09:48,508 --> 00:09:57,008
いつか風真も、誰かの支えになれる日が来るのだろうか。
Will the day ever come when Kazama, too, can become someone's support?

55
00:09:58,008 --> 00:10:00,016
こんな世界、きっと...
In a world like this, surely...

56
00:10:11,826 --> 00:10:17,386
だれかの心臓になれたなら
If I could become someone's heart...

57
00:10:25,146 --> 00:10:27,766
街も人も歪み出した
The town and people began to distort,

58
00:10:27,766 --> 00:10:33,466
化け物だと気付いたんだ
realizing that I was a monster,

59
00:10:33,466 --> 00:10:37,346
欲動に巣食った愚かさも全てがこの目に映る
even the foolishness preying on desires reflects in these eyes.

60
00:10:38,096 --> 00:10:44,816
シアトリカルに手の上で誰も彼も踊らされる
Theatrically, everyone is made to dance in the palm of a hand.

61
00:10:45,016 --> 00:10:51,266
生まれた意味だって知らぬまま形骸化した夢は錆びついてしまった
Without even knowing the meaning of birth, the fossilized dreams have rusted away.

62
00:10:51,866 --> 00:10:55,366
「愛をください」きっとだれもがそう願った
"Please give me love"—surely everyone wished for it,

63
00:10:55,566 --> 00:10:59,066
「愛をください」そっと震えた手を取って
"Please give me love"—gently taking my trembling hand,

64
00:10:59,266 --> 00:11:04,966
「愛をください」心を抉る醜いくらいに美しい愛を
"Please give me love"—a love so terribly, beautifully tearing at the heart.

65
00:11:05,166 --> 00:11:10,966
「こんな世界」と嘆くだれかの生きる理由になれるでしょうか
Could I become the reason to live for someone lamenting "such a world"?

66
00:11:11,166 --> 00:11:17,666
いつか終わると気付いた日から死へと秒を読む心臓だ
From the day I realized it would someday end, this is a heart counting down the seconds to death.

67
00:11:18,066 --> 00:11:23,766
ねえこのまま雨に溺れて藍に融けたって構わないから
Hey, if we drown in the rain like this, I don't care if we melt into indigo.

68
00:11:23,966 --> 00:11:30,366
どうかどうかまたあの日のように傘を差し出し笑ってみせてよ
Please, please, just like that day, hold out an umbrella and smile for me.

69
00:11:31,066 --> 00:11:37,366
だれかの心臓になれたなら
If I could become someone's heart...

70
00:11:44,466 --> 00:11:50,666
もしも夢が覚めなければ姿を変えずにいられた？
If only the dream hadn't awakened, could I have remained without changing my form?

71
00:11:50,866 --> 00:11:57,166
解けた指から消える温度血を廻らせるのはだれの思い出？
The warmth fading from untwined fingers—whose memories are making the blood circulate?

72
00:11:57,566 --> 00:12:03,966
雨に濡れた廃線煤けた病棟並んだ送電塔夕暮れのバス停止まったままの観覧車
Rain-soaked abandoned lines, soot-stained wards, lined-up transmission towers, a twilight bus stop, a Ferris wheel stuck in place...

73
00:12:04,166 --> 00:12:10,866
机に咲く花君の声も何もかも最初から無かったみたい
Flowers blooming on a desk, your voice too—it's as if everything was never there from the start.

74
00:12:12,166 --> 00:12:18,866
死にたい僕は今日も息をして生きたい君は明日を見失って
I, who want to die, breathe today as well; you, who want to live, lose sight of tomorrow.

75
00:12:19,066 --> 00:12:25,466
なのにどうして悲しいのだろういずれ死するのが人間だ
Yet why is it so sad? Humans are creatures destined to die eventually.

76
00:12:25,866 --> 00:12:29,966
永遠なんてないけど思い通りの日々じゃないけど
Though there is no eternity, though these aren't the days I wished for,

77
00:12:30,166 --> 00:12:37,866
脆く弱い糸に繋がれた次の夜明けがまた訪れる
connected by a fragile, weak thread, the next dawn visits once again.

78
00:12:38,566 --> 00:12:44,866
どんな世界も君がいるなら生きていたいって思えたんだよ
In any world, if you are here, I found myself wanting to live.

79
00:12:45,066 --> 00:12:51,466
僕の地獄で君はいつでも絶えず鼓動する心臓だ
In my hell, you are always a heart beating endlessly.

80
00:12:52,166 --> 00:13:02,866
いつしか君がくれたように僕も、だれかの心臓になれたなら
Just as you gave to me before, if I too could become someone's heart...

81
00:13:52,709 --> 00:13:55,789
風真も…わ…
Kazama...

82
00:13:57,509 --> 00:13:59,769
あっ、ぽこべ！
Ah, Pokobe!

83
00:14:00,029 --> 00:14:03,489
よかった！無事でござるか？
Thank goodness! Are you safe?

84
00:14:03,669 --> 00:14:06,509
もう本当に探したんですよ。
I searched everywhere for you, you know.

85
00:14:06,709 --> 00:14:07,769
無事ですか？
Are you alright?

86
00:14:08,029 --> 00:14:09,349
よかったぁ…
Thank goodness...

87
00:14:11,089 --> 00:14:18,509
ねえ、ぽこべ。風真も、誰かのために…なれるかな？
Hey, Pokobe. Can Kazama... also become someone's...?

88
00:14:20,969 --> 00:14:22,469
ん？何？何々？
Hm? What? What is it?

89
00:14:22,589 --> 00:14:29,709
あ、外の世界には風真を必要とする仲間が必ずいる？本当に？
Ah, out in the outside world, there are definitely comrades who need Kazama? Really?

90
00:14:31,069 --> 00:14:34,069
そ、そうでござるか？
Is, is that so?

91
00:14:35,049 --> 00:14:36,589
う、何？
Um, what?

92
00:14:37,349 --> 00:14:43,749
あ、それにまだ外の世界にはたくさんの面白い見ぬことも待ってる？
Ah, and besides, out in the outside world, there are also lots of interesting and unseen things waiting?

93
00:14:44,289 --> 00:14:48,829
確かに、そうかもしれないでござるな。
Indeed, that might be true.

94
00:14:50,029 --> 00:14:53,989
確かにそんな気がしてきた！ぽこべ、ありがとうでござる！
I'm starting to feel that way too! Thank you, Pokobe!

95
00:14:55,349 --> 00:14:59,409
お、そんな話してたら見て！雨も止んだ、晴れてきたでござる！
Oh, while we were talking about that, look! The rain has stopped, it's cleared up!

96
00:15:00,795 --> 00:15:05,795
そうだよね、まだまだ知らないこといっぱいあるから見に行かなきゃいけないでござるよな。
That's right. There's still so much we don't know, so we've got to go check it out.

97
00:15:06,965 --> 00:15:12,445
よし、まだまだね、知らないこと一緒に探しに行くでござる。
Alright, let's go search for things we still don't know together.

98
00:15:12,775 --> 00:15:17,775
まだ見ぬ仲間をともに歩んでいくでござる。
Let's walk together to find friends we haven't met yet.

99
00:15:22,444 --> 00:15:30,354
ラプ殿へ いつもはすぐ煽ったりバカにするけど 今日だけは特別に言います。
To Lady Laplus: You always tease me and act silly right away, but just for today, I'll say this specially.

100
00:15:31,074 --> 00:15:39,574
人見知りだった風真に明るく気兼ねなく接して 話しかけてくれてありがとう。
Thank you for talking to shy little Kazama so brightly and casually without holding back.

101
00:15:39,974 --> 00:15:46,494
ラプ殿と出会って 友達になれて 本当によかった。
I'm so glad I met Lady Laplus and was able to become friends with you.

102
00:15:46,824 --> 00:15:55,724
holoXの総帥がラプ殿でよかった。ありがとう、大好きだよ。
I'm so glad Lady Laplus is the commander of holoX. Thank you, I love you!

103
00:16:14,373 --> 00:16:16,153
何回言っても聞く耳持たない
No matter how many times I tell you, you won't listen.

104
00:16:16,153 --> 00:16:19,013
不勉強アウトサイダー 廊下全力ダッシュ
Unstudying outsider, dashing full speed in the hallway!

105
00:16:19,493 --> 00:16:21,873
そこの君止まりなさい だから止まりなさい
You there, stop right now! So stop right there!

106
00:16:22,403 --> 00:16:24,443
あーうるさいなんだよ 急いでんだよ
Ah, so annoying! I'm in a rush!

107
00:16:24,443 --> 00:16:28,483
わざわざ暇なんですか 誰もいないしこれぐらいいいだろ
Do you have time to waste on purpose? Nobody's around, so this much is fine, right?

108
00:16:29,833 --> 00:16:31,983
君に構う暇はないから
Since I don't have time to bother with you,

109
00:16:31,983 --> 00:16:34,053
じゃあね
See ya!

110
00:16:34,053 --> 00:16:39,143
ねえねえちょっと聞いてんの 風紀を乱すなって言ってんの
Hey hey, are you listening to me? I said stop disrupting public morals!

111
00:16:39,723 --> 00:16:42,623
あーはいはいもうわかりました まー聞く気はないけどね
Ah yes yes, I understand already, though I have no intention of listening!

112
00:16:43,943 --> 00:16:46,433
いやほんと お前なんかめっちゃ嫌いだ! 怒っちゃってんの
Man, seriously, I hate you so much! Are you getting mad?

113
00:16:46,433 --> 00:16:49,643
あーらざまみろ いや絶対におれの方が上って言って競ってまたギラギラ
Serves you right! Saying definitely I'm higher and competing again, flashing fiercely

114
00:16:49,643 --> 00:16:52,353
ギラギラ
Flashing fiercely

115
00:17:04,773 --> 00:17:07,153
一体なんの為になるのやら
What on earth is this even good for?

116
00:17:07,153 --> 00:17:09,943
ド勤勉真面目ヤクザ 少しルール破ったぐらいでキレすぎだろ
You hardcore studious serious yakuza, getting way too mad over breaking a few rules!

117
00:17:12,813 --> 00:17:15,573
