No matter how many times I say it, it's not enough!

391
00:44:45,914 --> 00:44:48,614
声に出して 39（サンキュー）
Saying it out loud: Thank you!

392
00:44:48,914 --> 00:44:51,614
あれ,なんだかアタシの名前みたい
Wait, that sounds a bit like my name!

393
00:44:51,914 --> 00:44:55,414
今日もありがとう
Thank you for today as well!

394
00:44:55,714 --> 00:44:59,614
今日もありがとう
Thank you today too.

395
00:45:00,392 --> 00:45:06,222
はじめましてとか　何回言ったっけ
How many times did I say "Nice to meet you"?

396
00:45:08,522 --> 00:45:13,192
アタシ本当に嬉しかったんだ
I was truly so happy.

397
00:45:13,992 --> 00:45:19,522
ワクワクしてるよ　これからもずっと広がっていくんだ
I'm so excited, it'll keep expanding forever from now on.

398
00:45:20,422 --> 00:45:25,192
繋がっていけるんだ　跳ねる音を紡ぎ描いてく
We can stay connected, weaving and drawing bouncing sounds.

399
00:45:25,922 --> 00:45:31,292
筆先奏でて　音を追って　生まれてく輪の中で
Playing with the brush tips, chasing the notes within the circle being born.

400
00:45:31,822 --> 00:45:36,522
泣きたくなること　たくさんあったよ
There were so many times I wanted to cry.

401
00:45:37,122 --> 00:45:41,992
でも笑ってばかりだったから
But because I was always smiling instead,

402
00:45:42,422 --> 00:45:47,192
ごめんね　ありがとう
I'm sorry, and thank you.

403
00:45:47,922 --> 00:45:52,992
逢い合わせだよ　お返しするよ
It's a mutual encounter, I'll return the favor.

404
00:45:53,422 --> 00:45:58,522
プレゼント　アタシだけもらってばかりじゃイヤだから
Presents—I hate only being the one receiving them,

405
00:45:59,022 --> 00:46:03,292
受け取ってもらえなきゃ困る　この歌を
so you have to accept this song or I'll be in trouble!

406
00:46:08,822 --> 00:46:13,522
君に出会って　みんなに出会って　アタシに出会って　よかったよ
I met you, I met everyone, I met myself, and I'm so glad I did!

407
00:46:14,322 --> 00:46:19,722
何回言ったって足りないよ
No matter how many times I say it, it's not enough!

408
00:46:20,222 --> 00:46:24,992
声に出してサンキュー！　あれなんだか
Saying it out loud—Thank you! Wait, somehow

409
00:46:25,422 --> 00:46:30,192
アタシの名前みたい
it's like my own name.

410
00:46:30,622 --> 00:46:35,522
今日もそして明日だって　この先だって　アタシはずっとここにいる
Today, tomorrow, and from now on, I'll always be right here!

411
00:46:36,222 --> 00:46:41,292
何かあったらすぐに来てよ　歌うよ
If anything happens, come right over, I'll sing for you!

412
00:46:41,722 --> 00:46:46,792
なんとだって　初めましても　まぁさあ　また久しぶりも
No matter what, whether it's "nice to meet you" or "well, hello again",

413
00:46:47,222 --> 00:46:51,522
みんなありがとうね
thank you everyone!

414
00:47:15,922 --> 00:47:20,422
皆んなありがとう！
Thank you everyone!

415
00:47:35,072 --> 00:47:40,572
はーい！はーい、はい、はい！
Ha-i! Ha-i, hai, hai!

416
00:47:40,772 --> 00:47:45,572
1回水飲んでいい？ ふぅ……。
Can I drink some water for a second? Whew...

417
00:47:47,072 --> 00:47:52,072
水飲ませて……。しょっ。
Let me drink some water... There.

418
00:47:54,072 --> 00:48:02,572
ふぅ……！ 2曲連続……ふぅ、ふぅ、歌わせていただきましたー！
Whew...! That was... two songs in a row... whew, whew, I just sang!

419
00:48:02,872 --> 00:48:13,572
はーい！いかがだったでしょうか？ね、アイドルになったんでヒーローイン育成計画と、そしてみなさんにね、ありがとうの気持ちを込めてサンキューをお届けさせていただきましたー！
Ha-i! How was that? Since I became an idol, I performed "Heroine Ikusei Keikaku" and delivered "Thank You" to express my gratitude to everyone!

420
00:48:14,272 --> 00:48:19,572
ありがとうございます！やばい！喋んなきゃいけないことがこれからいっぱいあるんですけども
Thank you so much! Oh no! There's so much I have to talk about from now on, but...

421
00:48:19,672 --> 00:48:26,572
っていうことはみなさんに何が来るか分かりますね？そうです！これから怒涛の告知タイムです！いぇーい！
That means you all know what's coming next, right? That's right! It's time for major announcements! Yay!

422
00:48:27,572 --> 00:48:30,872
ちょっとお付き合いくださいね。お願いしますね。
Please bear with me. I'm counting on you!

423
00:48:31,072 --> 00:48:40,872
それではですね、まず、いっぱいあるんですけど、1つ目から！まず風真いろは、今回もグッズが出ます！こちら、どん！
Well then, first of all, there's a lot, but starting with the first one! First, Kazama Iroha, merchandise is coming out this time too! Here it is, ta-da!

424
00:48:41,072 --> 00:48:47,072
[Title: 活動2周年記念]
[Sign: 活動2周年記念フルセット]
[Title: 2nd Anniversary]
[Sign: 2nd Anniversary Commemorative Full Set]

425
00:48:41,272 --> 00:48:47,572
きゃー！風真いろは活動2周年記念グッズ、発売が決定でございまーす！
Kyaa! The release of Kazama Iroha's 2nd anniversary commemorative merchandise has been decided!

426
00:48:48,072 --> 00:49:01,072
いや本当にね、素晴らしい！今回もですね、みなさんと色々考えた、あの、意見交換会を参考に作らせていただきましたので、ぜひね、1つずつ見ていければと思います。じゃあまず1個目から見ていきましょうか！
Oh really, it's wonderful! This time too, based on the opinion exchange meeting we had with everyone, we made these, so I hope we can look at them one by one. Well then, let's start with the first item!

427
00:49:02,072 --> 00:49:12,072
[Title: 2層アクリルパネル]
[Sign: イラスト：さいね / サイズ：約H200×W150mm / 素材：アクリル・鉄]
[Title: 2-Layer Acrylic Panel]
[Sign: Illustration: Saine / Size: Approx. H200 x W150mm / Material: Acrylic, Iron]

428
00:49:02,572 --> 00:49:12,572
それじゃあこちら！ こちらです！ 超微麗二層アクリルパネル！ なんと新仕様での飾り物は初めて！ ということで
Now then, here! Here it is! A super fine 2-layer acrylic panel, and it's the first time with this new decoration specification! So...

429
00:49:13,072 --> 00:49:18,572
見た目もとってもいい感じですよね。イラストはさいね先生に描いていただきました！
it looks really wonderful too. The illustration was drawn by Saine-sensei!

430
00:49:19,072 --> 00:49:28,072
めっちゃね、すごいんだよ！ この、超微麗って風真が言ってるくらいだから、ちょっと伝わるかわかんないけど、超微麗なのマジで！ なのでぜひね、みなさんのおうちに置いていただければなと思います。
It's super amazing, you know! As Kazama calls it "super fine", I don't know if it gets across, but it's seriously super fine! So I hope you can place it in your homes, everyone.

431
00:49:29,572 --> 00:49:37,572
[Title: かざま隊証明書]
[Sign: かざま隊証明書 / シリアルナンバー入り！ / イラスト：さいね / サイズ：カード/約H54×W85.5mm / 素材：カード/PVC（プラカード） / 台紙/約A5]
[Title: Kazama Corps Certificate]
[Sign: Kazama Corps Certificate / With Serial Number! / Illustration: Saine / Size: Card/Approx. H54 x W85.5mm / Material: Card/PVC (Plastic Card) / Mount/Approx. A5]

432
00:49:30,072 --> 00:49:40,072
はい！次に行きました！風真隊証明書でござる！いぇーい！大変お待たせいたしました！
Yes! Moving on! It's the Kazama Corps Certificate! Yay! Thank you for waiting!

433
00:49:41,072 --> 00:49:54,072
実はですね、みなさんから多くリクエストをいただいておりました証明書、今回作らせていただきました！ 表面にシリアルナンバーが書いてあって、裏面には複製のメッセージが書いてあるので
Actually, we received a lot of requests from everyone for a certificate, and we had it made this time! The front has a serial number written on it, and the back has a duplicated message written on it, so

434
00:49:54,572 --> 00:49:59,072
ぜひね、みなさん入手してからの楽しみということで、名前書くとこあるからみんな名前ちゃんとマジックペンで書いてね！ よろしくお願いします！
definitely, as something to look forward to after getting it, there's a place to write your name so everyone please write your name properly with a magic pen! Thank you!

435
00:50:00,160 --> 00:50:08,080
皆の者もこれをね、入手して風間隊にならないかっていうね、お誘いでございますので、ぜひ皆も買って、持ち歩いてくださいね！では次！
So everyone, please get this and join the Kazama-tai! That's my invitation, so please buy it and carry it around with you! Now, next!

436
00:50:10,280 --> 00:50:18,880
はい、ランダム缶バッジ！ということでですね、今回作らせていただきました、全4種からランダムでお1つお届けでござる！
Yes, random can badges! So, these were made for us, and you will receive one at random out of all 4 types!

437
00:50:19,480 --> 00:50:25,680
通常衣装、お正月衣装、えっと新衣装、ポコベの通常の4種類ありますね。
There are 4 types: the default outfit, New Year outfit, um, new outfit, and normal Pokobe.

438
00:50:26,180 --> 00:50:46,580
お正月衣装って、実物にするの初めてなんですよう！なのでですね、コンプを目指してもいいですし、あの買った時に何が届くかウキウキワクワクドキドキして貰ってもいいのでぜひぜひよろしくお願いします！イラストはですね色々切り抜きとかもされている、もうちみこ先生に描いていただきました！ありがとうございます！
Actually, this is the first time we're making actual goods with the New Year outfit! So, you can aim for the complete set, or you can get excited wondering what will arrive when you buy it, so please definitely check it out! The illustrations were drawn by Chimiko-sensei, who has also done various clippings! Thank you very much!

439
00:50:49,180 --> 00:51:34,580
はい、最後はショルダーバッグ！なんでショルダーバッグなの？と聞いたそこあなた！そう、こういうねアパレル系もあったらいいなっていう意見と、なんと今回ですねこちらのチャックがついてて前面側がビニール、の仕様になってまして、つまりどういうことかといいますと、あの
Yes, lastly is the shoulder bag! You out there asking why a shoulder bag? That's right, there was feedback that it would be nice to have apparel items like this, and amazingly this time, it has a zipper and the front side is made of vinyl specification, which means, um,

440
00:51:34,580 --> 00:51:36,580
痛バッグが作れる
you can make an itabag!

441
00:51:36,580 --> 00:51:54,280
ショルダーバッグになっております！痛バッグが作れます！推しタントたちの中で俺私痛バッグ作ってみたけどまだっていう人がいたらぜひ今回のねこのショルダーバッグ買っていただいて、で一緒に付いてくる、付いてくる？今回同時販売してる缶バッジとか証明書とかをね中に入れて皆さんのオリジナルの痛バッグ、かざまいろは痛バッグ作ってくださいねー！
It becomes a shoulder bag! You can make an itabag! If there are any Oshi-tantos out there who think, "I want to make an itabag but haven't yet," then please buy this shoulder bag this time, and put the can badges or certificates that come with it—or are being sold alongside it—inside and make your own original itabag, a Kazama Iroha itabag!

442
00:51:55,280 --> 00:52:10,580
そして次！えーっと、そしてフルセットがこちらー！こんな感じになっております！豪華でしょ！豪華になっております。そして今回もですね、あるの？という質問が来るかと思いますので、今回数量限定直筆サインあります！
And next! Um, and here is the full set! This is how it looks! Isn't it gorgeous? It's gorgeous. And this time too, since you might ask if it exists, this time there is a limited quantity with a handwritten autograph!

443
00:52:10,580 --> 00:52:32,080
はい！複製メッセージと、そして限定ボイスがついてくる数量限定の、ええと、バージョンのフルセットとあと通常バージョンの2種類ありますので、この後21時からなんですけど、もしかしたらライブの途中に販売が開始してしまうかもしれないので、ちょっと押しちゃうかもなんで、配信見ながら数量限定買ってください、すいませんお願いします！
Yes! There are two versions: a quantity-limited version that comes with a duplicated message and limited voice, and a regular version. Sales start at 21:00 after this, but sales might start in the middle of the live, so please buy the quantity-limited one while watching the stream, sorry, please!

444
00:52:32,080 --> 00:52:33,580
はあ…
Hah...

445
00:52:46,580 --> 00:53:27,580
そして告知をさせていただきます！この後21時10分頃から、ええと、もしかしたら変更するかもしれないけど5分ぐらい、ええ、かざまいろは1曲目のオリジナル曲「いろはすてっぷ！」のMVを公開させていただきます、こちらです！遅くなってごめんね！遅くなってごめんねみんな！お待たせ致しました！色々事情がありましてちょっと遅くなってしまったんですけどこの2周年というこのタイミングで出させていただくことができました。本当にありがとうございます！本当にありがとうございます！21時10分から公開予定ですのでプレミア公開よかったらたくさん聴いてくださいよろしくお願いします！
And I have an announcement! Starting around 21:10, um, the schedule might change by about 5 minutes or so, um, we will premiere the MV of Kazama Iroha's 1st original song "Iroha Step!" right here! Sorry for being late! Sorry for being late everyone! Thank you for waiting! Um, due to various circumstances, it got a little late, but I was able to release it at this 2nd anniversary timing. Thank you so much! Thank you so much! It's scheduled to premiere at 21:10, so please listen to it a lot during the premiere, thank you very much!

446
00:53:38,336 --> 00:53:48,196
この流れで告知をするのがあれなんですけども、なんとこの度風真いろはオリジナル曲2曲目ができましたー！
It's a bit unusual to make an announcement right in this flow, but... Kazama Iroha's second original song has been completed!

447
00:53:48,896 --> 00:53:57,276
曲はこちら、はい。「風を仰ぎし麗容な」という曲になっております。
Here is the song. Yes, it's called "Kaze o Aogishi Reiyō na".

448
00:53:58,056 --> 00:54:17,156
わあかっこいいでござるな、なんてイケメンなんだろう。いろはステップと比較すると、いい意味で「誰やお前」ってなる感じのオリジナル曲になっておりまして、
Wow, how cool, what a handsome look. Compared to "Iroha Step", it's an original song where you'll think, "Who on earth are you?!", in a good way,

449
00:54:17,156 --> 00:54:30,236
ええ風真の心の中の葛藤を強くなりたいという気持ちを歌詞にしてもらった曲になっております。ええこちらですね、作詞・作曲は雄のすけ様にしていただきました！本当にありがとうございます！
and it's a song where the lyrics express Kazama's inner conflicts and her desire to become stronger. Um, this was composed by Yunosuke-sama! Thank you so much!

450
00:54:31,156 --> 00:54:32,416
もう一回お水飲みます！
I'll drink some water again!

451
00:54:46,696 --> 00:55:00,168
ふう、というわけでいま紹介させていただきました風を仰ぎし麗容な、さっそくですがダンス付きでオリ曲初披露させていただきます。それでは聞いてください、よろしくお願いいたします！
Whew, so as I just introduced, "Kaze o Aogishi Reiyō na", we will now perform our original song for the first time with dancing. Please listen, thank you very much!

452
00:55:09,608 --> 00:55:15,408
風を仰ぎし麗容な
Looking up at the wind, elegant...

453
00:55:15,408 --> 00:55:20,008
心寄せ仄か歌う
Singing faintly with a devoted heart.

454
00:55:25,108 --> 00:55:29,008
花の根になりたい
I want to become the roots of the flowers.

455
00:55:29,008 --> 00:55:36,608
色づくその前より しかと地に立ちたい
Before the colors bloom, I want to stand firmly on the ground.

456
00:55:36,808 --> 00:55:40,908
口火を芽吹かせる
Igniting the spark into growth.

457
00:55:41,008 --> 00:55:48,408
遣らずの雨が降ろうと 惰性に時を啜ることなく
Even if the parting rain falls, without sipping away time in complacency,

458
00:55:48,408 --> 00:55:56,908
よろずの声を灯せば 油煙も在りし日の記憶にできるから
If I light up countless voices, even greasy smoke can become memories of days gone by.

459
00:55:59,908 --> 00:56:05,008
涙雲に一縷の風が吹く
A wisp of wind blows through the tearful clouds.

460
00:56:05,008 --> 00:56:12,408
桜は散らなければ愛されないと 光らぬ羽虫に夏なしと比べられようが
They may compare me: "Cherry blossoms aren't loved unless they fall," "Without light, summer flies have no summer," rest assured—

461
00:56:12,808 --> 00:56:20,008
竹をかち割るぐらい 身を切るぐらいに凪を打つ 有り明けの先で
Like splitting bamboo, striking a calm that cuts to the bone beyond the break of dawn.

462
00:56:26,208 --> 00:56:31,008
心寄せ仄か歌う
Singing faintly with a devoted heart.

463
00:56:34,608 --> 00:56:44,408
常しえに遥か忍ぶ 一徹の一滴を 垂らし続ける清水の如く
Silently yearning across eternity, like clear water continuing to drip a single stubborn drop,

464
00:56:44,808 --> 00:56:51,408
頑丈で強情な心臓でも 湧き溶かす志向に
Even a sturdy, stubborn heart melting into the aspiration that wells up,

465
00:56:52,308 --> 00:57:00,308
奮い起こした余勢は 旋の旗を揺らし誘う
The momentum we stirred up sways the swirling banner and invites us,

466
00:57:00,508 --> 00:57:08,608
野道を進む驥足で 含むところもなく 自分を見出して
With the swift strides of a steed walking the country road, with nothing held back, discovering one's true self,

467
00:57:10,008 --> 00:57:15,708
夢幻城に頂く風よ 差し向かえ
Oh wind crowning the castle of illusions, face forward!

468
00:57:22,108 --> 00:57:26,908
心寄せ仄か歌う
Singing faintly with a devoted heart.

469
00:57:30,108 --> 00:57:35,908
留まらず澄み渡る かの果ては ただ麗容ならば
Unstoppable and crystal clear, that destination—if it is pure elegance,

470
00:57:36,008 --> 00:57:47,408
赴くがままに風を仰ぎ 垢抜けて まだ麗容ならば 直向きな姿に追い風は
Looking up at the wind as it roams, refining yourself further—if you remain graceful, a tailwind will blow upon your earnest form...

471
00:58:02,408 --> 00:58:10,008
桜は散らなければ愛されないと 光らぬ羽虫に夏なしと比べられようが
They may compare me: "Cherry blossoms aren't loved unless they fall," "Without light, summer flies have no summer," rest assured—

472
00:58:11,808 --> 00:58:19,608
竹をかち割るぐらい 身を切るぐらいに凪を打つ 有り明けの先で
Like splitting bamboo, striking a calm that cuts to the bone beyond the break of dawn.

473
00:58:25,408 --> 00:58:30,308
心寄せ仄か歌う
Singing faintly with a devoted heart.

474
00:58:33,308 --> 00:58:40,208
常しえに遥か忍ぶ 金色の髪が靡く
Eternally yearning in the distance, golden hair flutters in the wind.

475
00:59:01,938 --> 00:59:06,738
みんな新しいオリジナル曲聴いてくれてありがとうございました！
Thank you so much for listening to my brand-new original song!

476
00:59:07,238 --> 00:59:14,438
楽しい時間はあっというま！次が最後の曲です！最後まで全力で楽しんでってね！
Fun time passes in a flash! This next song is the last one! Have fun with all your might until the very end!

477
00:59:14,838 --> 00:59:21,338
ごめん！憧れてた！追いかけてた！いつまでもそうでいたかった！
Sorry! I admired you! I chased after you! I wanted to stay just like that forever!

478
00:59:21,838 --> 00:59:25,838
完璧なあなた！嫌いになった！
You, who were perfect! I grew to hate you!

479
00:59:27,238 --> 00:59:36,238
同じように愛もらって育ったのに いつからか差が開いてた
Even though we grew up receiving the same love, when did that gap start to open?

480
00:59:36,238 --> 00:59:41,338
劣等感漂って 知りたかった
Inferiority drifting around, I wanted to know.

481
00:59:41,838 --> 00:59:48,838
ねぇ メイビー 神様は試練与えた 強くなれよと
Hey, maybe God gave us trials, telling us to become strong—

482
00:59:49,038 --> 00:59:54,838
ウザい 平等なんて嘘つきとわかってるけど
How annoying, even though I know equality is a lie,

483
00:59:55,238 --> 01:00:00,038
可愛いとか 譲れないとか 諦めないの
Wanting to be cute, refusing to back down, I won't give up!

484
01:00:00,450 --> 01:00:01,890
ごめん憧れてた追いかけてた
Sorry, I used to admire and follow you...

485
01:00:01,890 --> 01:00:04,470
いつまでもそうでいたかった
I wanted to stay that way forever.

486
01:00:05,010 --> 01:00:08,670
完璧なあなた嫌になった
I grew to hate your perfect self.

487
01:00:08,670 --> 01:00:11,550
同じように愛もらって育ったのに
Even though we were raised receiving the same love,

488
01:00:11,550 --> 01:00:15,030
いつからか差が開いてた
a gap started opening up before I knew it.

489
01:00:15,030 --> 01:00:18,550
八つ当たりだってしたかった
I even wanted to take out my frustration.

490
01:00:18,550 --> 01:00:21,970
私らしくいこう 暇じゃない人生
Let's live our own way, life is too busy!

491
01:00:24,870 --> 01:00:26,610
生きよう
Let's live on!

492
01:00:37,990 --> 01:00:44,710
だって焦ればキリがなくて ないもの全部欲しがって 鏡を覗いて
Because if you rush there's no end, wanting everything you don't have, peering into the mirror,

493
01:00:44,710 --> 01:00:48,970
「ため息は甘えだった」と悩んでいた
fretting over the thought that 'my sighs were just me being spoiled.'

494
01:00:48,970 --> 01:00:55,870
知らなかった みんなと同じだと安心していた ピント外れと
I didn't know... feeling relieved that I was just like everyone else, completely missing the mark,

495
01:00:59,870 --> 01:01:04,730
揺らいでいくの Maybe 神様は楽しんでる
Wavering... Maybe God is having fun

496
01:01:04,730 --> 01:01:08,370
予測できない人を私はそれ以上に
and I'm going to enjoy unpredictable people even more than that!

497
01:01:08,370 --> 01:01:17,490
楽しんでやろうぜ 勉強とかお仕事とか 諦めないの女の子だし 元気よく 愛想よく
Let's have fun with it! Never giving up on studying or work, as a girl, with lots of energy and charm,

498
01:01:17,490 --> 01:01:21,530
たまにはクールに☆ついてきて
and sometimes being cool☆ — follow me!

499
01:01:21,530 --> 01:01:24,550
愛した分 愛されるの
The more you love, the more you are loved

500
01:01:24,550 --> 01:01:31,170
お母さんがくれたアドバイス さあ出かけよう 毎日を大切に
That's Mom's advice! So let's head out and cherish every single day!

501
01:01:31,170 --> 01:01:35,530
愛した分 愛されるの
The more you love, the more you are loved,

502
01:01:35,530 --> 01:01:40,570
お母さんがくれたアドバイス さあ飛び出そう 毎日を大切に
That's Mom's advice! So let's leap out and cherish every single day!

503
01:01:40,570 --> 01:01:47,430
胸張って生きる さらけ出せば
Living with your head held high, if you bare your heart,

504
01:01:47,430 --> 01:02:02,290
心が温められてたんだ "好きに言ってろ"痛くない
your heart will warm up... "Say whatever you want," it doesn't hurt!

505
01:02:16,690 --> 01:02:22,610
神様は夢与えた 変われるために サンキュー 乗っかってやるよ
God gave us dreams so we could change. Thank you, I'll ride along with it!

506
01:02:22,610 --> 01:02:29,470
最後まで付き合って貰うよ 雨はやんで傘を閉じた
You'll stick with me until the very end. The rain stopped and I closed my umbrella,

507
01:02:29,470 --> 01:02:35,490
今まで見えてなかった景色 透明が反射して
seeing scenery I couldn't see until now, transparent things reflecting,

508
01:02:35,490 --> 01:02:41,690
世界を照らし出す 胸踊る
illuminating the world, making my heart dance!

509
01:02:41,690 --> 01:02:46,090
可愛いとか持てたいとか 諦めないの女の子だし
Wanting to be cute, wanting to be adored—as a girl, I won't give up!

510
01:02:46,090 --> 01:02:50,150
しおらしくね猫かぶり ナンバーワンでしょ
Acting sweet and playing innocent, I'm number one, right?

511
01:02:50,150 --> 01:02:56,610
愛した分 愛されるのお母さんがくれたアドバイス さあ出かけよう
The more you love, the more you are loved—that's Mom's advice! So let's head out!

512
01:02:56,610 --> 01:03:00,770
愛した分 愛されるの
The more you love, the more you are loved,

513
01:03:00,770 --> 01:03:05,250
お母さんがくれたアドバイス さあ飛び出そう
That's Mom's advice! So let's leap out!

514
01:03:05,250 --> 01:03:13,390
毎日を大切に 好きに生きてやろうぜ 勉強とかお仕事とか 諦めないの女の子だし
Cherishing every day, living however you like! Not giving up on studying or work, as a girl,

515
01:03:13,390 --> 01:03:22,710
元気よく 愛想よく たまにはクールに☆ついてきて
with lots of energy and charm, and sometimes being cool☆ — follow me!

516
01:03:34,430 --> 01:03:37,470
みなのの、今日は来てくれて本当にありがとうございました！
Minano, thank you all so much for coming today!

517
01:03:37,850 --> 01:03:41,870
最高の二周年ライブになりました！
It became the best 2nd anniversary live ever!

518
01:03:41,970 --> 01:03:48,190
本当にありがとう！バイバーイでござるー！
Thank you so much! Bye-bye for now, de gozaru!

